  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Race to Resilience (RtR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will support the UN Climate Change High-Level Champions&#x2019; Race to Resilience campaign (RtR). RtR promotes action by Non-State Actors (NSAs) to achieve its goal of helping make 4 billion people from vulnerable groups and communities resilient to climate impacts by 2030. The RtR campaign is the mechanism to bring NSAs, include businesses, financial institutions, cities, regions, and civil society, into the UNFCCC process. RtR NSA partners pledge to contribute to the goal, share and implement clear plans towards achieving it, and publicly report progress using the metrics framework developed by the RtR team. The UKs investment will support the Climate Champions Team in delivering their ambitious work plan set out by the High-Level Champions. Providing patient capital for the initial years of the programme will allow the RtR time and support to recruit more partners, including other donors, and fully develop its programme of activities in partnership with NSAs.</narrative>
  </description>
